| Debug build + per-call tracing. Equivalent to !MkDebug but also enables
| SMB2_DEBUG_VERBOSE, which turns on every per-call trace (SendRecv/response,
| Xlt path mangling, FS_file/func/open/args entry logging, NetBIOS name
| resolution, SMB1 search and transaction steps, NameCache flush/add/discard
| chatter). Fills Reporter's 8 MB ring fast, so only use this when you need
| the blow-by-blow for a specific sub-operation - not for a multi-hour build
| run.
|
Dir <Obey$Dir>
amu_machine debug OPTIONS="-DCHECK_ARMBOOT_EXISTS -DSMB2_DEBUG -DSMB2_DEBUG_VERBOSE" ROMSPRITES=FALSE
